WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.294
Rachel: Dad, what's my new teacher like?

2
00:00:05.295 --> 00:00:08.008
Father: She's very kind and

3
00:00:08.009 --> 00:00:11.136
friendly. She was Ricky's kindergarten teacher.

4
00:00:11.137 --> 00:00:16.776
Crossing guard: Good morning, Ricky! How are you today?

5
00:00:16.777 --> 00:00:18.599
Ricky: I'm fine, thank you.

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.350
Dad, Rachel! Come on!

7
00:00:21.351 --> 00:00:25.541
Father: Hello, Mrs. Kitty! It's nice to see you again.

8
00:00:25.542 --> 00:00:29.739
Crossing guard: It's nice to see you too, Mr.

9
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:32.109
Raccoon. What's your name, sweetie? Rachel:

10
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.006
My name is Rachel. It's

11
00:00:34.007 --> 00:00:36.819
my first day of school! Ricky: Come

12
00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.600
on! Let's go! Crossing

13
00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:43.867
guard: Don't cross the road without me, Ricky! Ricky:

14
00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:47.589
Yes, Mrs. Kitty. Rachel:

15
00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:50.406
What's that sign for? Crossing

16
00:00:50.407 --> 00:00:53.608
guard: This sign tells the cars to stop.

17
00:00:53.609 --> 00:00:57.112
Ricky: It also tells you to stop asking questions.

18
00:00:57.113 --> 00:01:04.268
Father: Ricky, we have lots of time. Don't

19
00:01:04.269 --> 00:01:10.880
worry! Okay, you guys, let's cross the street.

20
00:01:10.881 --> 00:01:15.229
Always wait for Mrs. Kitty to tell you it's safe to cross.

21
00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:21.872
Ricky: I know, Dad. I did this last year.

22
00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:27.321
Bye, Dad! Bye, Rachel! See you later. Father:

23
00:01:27.322 --> 00:01:30.756
Good-bye, Ricky. Have a nice day.

24
00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:34.874
Father: I will take you to your class now.

25
00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:38.941
When school is finished, I will come back to pick you up.

26
00:01:38.942 --> 00:01:40.824
Rachel: Okay, Dad!

27
00:01:40.825 --> 00:01:47.579
Father: Here we go.

